WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.400
[Calm electronic music]

00:01.000 --> 00:09.000
[Wheel motors hum as P2 drives in]

00:09.000 --> 00:09.600
[Whir and a click as the feet lower]

00:09.700 --> 00:14.000
[The edger pad brushes along the ceiling line]

00:14.200 --> 00:21.400
[The roller rolls on the wall while the lift hums]

00:23.300 --> 00:24.600
[Click as the Tool Port lets go]

00:26.900 --> 00:28.200
[Click as the Tool Port locks the next tool]

00:29.900 --> 00:33.200
[A click each time a tool locks]

00:33.800 --> 00:37.800
[The roller rolls the last lane]

00:38.000 --> 00:41.000
[A soft chime, the music ends]
